   "date": "2013-06-18",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The speaker opposed the Parliamentary Service Amendment (Freedom of Information) Bill 2013, arguing it would undermine transparency by restoring FOI exemptions for three parliamentary departments, and proposed amendments to keep them subject to FOI for administrative matters and MPs' pay and expenditure."
